        <UserObject label="Achieved width only" tooltip="No command and no force signal. An added sensor gives a raw reading that is related to the true finger gap by measuring known gaps.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Accompanying brief" detail="No command and no force signal. An added sensor gives a raw reading that is related to the true finger gap by measuring known gaps." source="Accompanying brief" status="" id="n32">
