        <UserObject label="Controller is the grip" tooltip="PICO 4 Ultra Enterprise controller held like a pistol, gripper as barrel. A printed two-part sleeve holds the controller tilted by 35° relative to the gripper, so that the grip slants back like a pistol grip (CAD; comfort untested), and leaves the tracking LEDs uncovered.&#xa;&#xa;Source: CAD design" detail="PICO 4 Ultra Enterprise controller held like a pistol, gripper as barrel. A printed two-part sleeve holds the controller tilted by 35° relative to the gripper, so that the grip slants back like a pistol grip (CAD; comfort untested), and leaves the tracking LEDs uncovered." source="CAD design" status="" id="n48">
